{"version":1,"slug":"Others__SIMILARITY_(8)","path":"Others/SIMILARITY (8).html","title":"devgagan","provider":"Others","category":"SIMILARITY (8).html","durationMinutes":60,"totalQuestions":20,"sectionsLocked":false,"sections":null,"questions":[{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the triad which follows the same pattern as that followed by the two triads given below. Both triads follow the same pattern.</p><p>BG  -  38 -  LQ</p><p>JO  -  70  -  TY</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2368;&#2330;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2342;&#2379; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2376;&#2335;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2340;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2325; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2346;&#2376;&#2335;&#2352;&#2381;&#2344; &#2325;&#2366; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>BG - 38 - LQ</p><p>JO - 70 - TY</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">MR  -  60  -  WB</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">MR  -  60  -  WB</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">CI  -  42  -  NS</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">CI  -  42  -  NS</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">FK  -  54  -  PU</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">FK  -  54  -  PU</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">SX  -  71  -  YZ</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">SX  -  71  -  YZ</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>BG  -  36  -  LQ</p><p>JO  -  70  -  TY</p><p>Here, the pattern is:</p><p>B+5= G; G+5= L; L+5= Q. Also, B+G+L+Q = 38.</p><p>J+5=O; O+5= T; T+5= Y. Also, J+O+T+Y = 70.</p><p>Option (a) MR  -  60  -  WB</p><p>M+5= R; R+5= W; W+5= B. Also, M+R+W+B = 56.</p><p>So, option (a) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (b) CI  -  42  -  NS</p><p>C+6=I; I+5= N; N+5= S. Also, C+I+N+S = 45.</p><p>So, option (b) is incorrect.</p><p>Option (c) FK  -  54  -  PU </p><p>F+5= K; K+5= P; P+5=U. Also, F+K+P+U = 54.</p><p>So, option (c) is correct.</p><p>Option (d) SX  -  71  -  YZ</p><p>S+5= X; X+1= Y; Y+1=Z. Also, S+X+Y+Z = 94.</p><p>So, option (d) is incorrect.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>In the given letter-cluster pairs, the first letter-cluster is related to the second letter-cluster following a certain logic. Study the given pairs carefully, and from the given options, select the pair that follows the same logic.</p><p>KGCB : PTXY</p><p>DSJQ : WHQJ </p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;-&#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2346;&#2361;&#2354;&#2366; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;-&#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2319;&#2325; &#2344;&#2367;&#2358;&#2381;&#2330;&#2367;&#2340; &#2340;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2325;&#2375; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2360;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;-&#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2344;&#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2357;&#2325; &#2309;&#2343;&#2381;&#2351;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;, &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2340;&#2352;&#2381;&#2325; &#2325;&#2366; &#2346;&#2366;&#2354;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>KGCB : PTXY</p><p>DSJQ : WHQJ </p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">YUFG : BVHL</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">YUFG : BVHL</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">MKSA : NPZH</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">MKSA : NPZH</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">BVSE : YWHV</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">BVSE : YWHV</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">EINO : VRML</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EINO : VRML</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>Here, each letter is replaced by its reverse alphabet as per the English alphabetical series. </p><p>The reverse pairs are A-Z; B-Y; C-X; D-W; E-V; F-U; G-T; H-S; I-R; J-Q; K-P; L-O; M-N. </p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option in which the terms are related in the same way as the terms given are related to each other.</p><p><b>FGHI : PQRS : BCDE</b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2346;&#2342; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;, &#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2342; &#2319;&#2325;-&#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><b>FGHI : PQRS : BCDE</b></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">GHIJ : PQRS : TUVW</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">GHIJ : PQRS : TUVW</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">EFGH : IJKL : MNOP</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EFGH : IJKL : MNOP</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">QRSU : WTXY : CDEF</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">QRSU : WTXY : CDEF</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">LMNO : VWXY : HIJK</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">LMNO : VWXY : HIJK</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p><b>FGHI</b> (J K L M N O) <b>PQRS</b> (T U V W X Y Z A) <b>BCDE</b></p><p>Similarly,</p><p><b>LMNO</b> (P Q R S T U) <b>VWXY</b> (Z A B C D E F G) <b>HIJK</b></p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the related letter from the given alternatives.</p><p>BF: HX :: ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306;|</p><p>BF: HX :: ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">EO: AC</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">EO: AC</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">CI: DK</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">CI: DK</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">GT: EO</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">GT: EO</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">IV: DN</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">IV: DN</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>The position values of the alphabets are used where A=1, B=2, C=3 and so on.</p><p>B(2) F(2x3): H(8) X(3x8)</p><p>E(5) O(3x5): A(1) C(3x1)</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option in which the two numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers in the given number pair.</p><p>32 : 85</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2342;&#2379;&#2344;&#2379;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p>32 : 85</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">42 : 75</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">42 : 75</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">28 : 91</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">28 : 91</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">38 : 77</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">38 : 77</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">24 : 77</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">24 : 77</span>"],"correct_option_id":3,"solution":"<p>32 : 85 = 32 : (32 + 53 =) 85</p><p>Option a:</p><p>42 : 75 = 42 : (42 + 53 =) 95 which is not equal to 75</p><p>Option b:</p><p>28 : 91 = 28 : (28 + 53 =) 81 which is not equal to 91</p><p>Option c:</p><p>38 : 77 = 38 : (38 + 53 =) 91 which is not equal to 77</p><p>Option d:</p><p>24 : 77 = 24 : (24 + 53 =) 77 which is equal to 77</p><p>So, Option (d) is the correct answer.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option in which the pair of letter-clusters share the same relationship as that shared by the given pair of letter-clusters.</p><p>MOB : KMZ :: ?</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;-&#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2357;&#2361;&#2368; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2360;&#2366;&#2333;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2340;&#2375; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2309;&#2325;&#2381;&#2359;&#2352;-&#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2360;&#2366;&#2333;&#2366; &#2325;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366; &#2327;&#2351;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>MOB : KMZ :: ?</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">AJK : YHN</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">AJK : YHN</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">LOP : JMN</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">LOP : JMN</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">BND : DLB</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">BND : DLB</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">STB : PRZ</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">STB : PRZ</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>MOB:KMZ</p><p>M  -  2 = K</p><p>O  -  2 = M</p><p>B  -  2 = Z</p><p>Option 1:</p><p>AJK : YHN</p><p>A  -  2 = Y</p><p>J  -  2 = H</p><p>K + 3 = N</p><p>So, AJK : YHN is not same as the given pair of letter-clusters.</p><p>Option 2:</p><p>LOP : JMN</p><p>L  -  2 = J</p><p>O  -  2 = M</p><p>P  -  2 = N</p><p>So, LOP : JMN is same as the given pair of letter-clusters.</p><p>Option 3:</p><p>BND : DLB</p><p>B + 2 = D</p><p>N - 2 = L</p><p>D - 2 = B</p><p>So, BND : DLB is not same as the given pair of letter-clusters.</p><p>Option 4:</p><p>STB : PRZ</p><p>S - 3 = P</p><p>T - 2 = R</p><p>B - 2 = Z</p><p>So, STB : PRZ is not same as the given pair of letter-clusters.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option in which the terms are related in the same way as the terms given are related to each other.</p><p><b>DCU : SAB : TBC</b></p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2352;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2340;&#2352;&#2361; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2358;&#2348;&#2381;&#2342; &#2319;&#2325;-&#2342;&#2370;&#2360;&#2352;&#2375; &#2360;&#2375; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404;</p><p><b>DCU : SAB : TBC</b></p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">FKV : TID : UJE</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">FKV : TID : UJE</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">FWI : GXJ : HYK</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">FWI : GXJ : HYK</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">HIO : GHN : IJP</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">HIO : GHN : IJP</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">MQZ : JRW : KSX</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">MQZ : JRW : KSX</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>DCU to SAB, letters are replaced by letters at a gap of one letter and the word is reversed. SAB to TBC, letters are replaced by immediate next letters in the alphabetical order.</p><p>Similarly, FKV to TID, letters are replaced by letters at a gap of one letter and the word is reversed. TID to UJE, letters are replaced by immediate next letters in the alphabetical order.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the set of numbers that is <b>not similar</b> to the following set of numbers.</p><p>(32, 5, 7)</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>(32, 5, 7)</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(16, 9, 7)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(16, 9, 7)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(45, 6, 9)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(45, 6, 9)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(28, 4, 12)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(28, 4, 12)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(52, 7, 3)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(52, 7, 3)</span>"],"correct_option_id":0,"solution":"<p>Logic in the given set of numbers  - </p><p>32 = 5<sup>2</sup> + 7</p><p>32 = 25 + 7</p><p>32 = 32</p><p>All the options follow the same logic expect option (a),</p><p>16 = 9 + 7</p><p>16 = 16</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the set in which the numbers are related in the same way as are the numbers of the following set:</p><p>(16, 12, 20)</p><p>(33, 41.66, 92)</p><p>(NOTE: Operations should be performed on the whole numbers, without breaking down the numbers into its constituent digits. E.g. 13 Operations on 13 such as adding /deleting /multiplying etc. to 13 can be performed. Breaking down 13 into 1 and 3 and then performing mathematical operations on 1 and 3 is NOT allowed)</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2351;&#2375; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360;&#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2313;&#2360;&#2368; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306; &#2332;&#2367;&#2360; &#2346;&#2381;&#2352;&#2325;&#2366;&#2352; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2368; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343;&#2367;&#2340; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;:</p><p>(16, 12, 20)</p><p>(33, 41.66, 92)</p><p>(&#2344;&#2379;&#2335;: &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2379; &#2313;&#2344;&#2325;&#2375; &#2328;&#2335;&#2325; &#2309;&#2306;&#2325;&#2379;&#2306; &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2357;&#2367;&#2349;&#2366;&#2332;&#2367;&#2340; &#2325;&#2367;&#2319; &#2348;&#2367;&#2344;&#2366; &#2346;&#2370;&#2352;&#2381;&#2339; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366;&#2344;&#2368; &#2330;&#2366;&#2361;&#2367;&#2319;&#2404; &#2313;&#2342;&#2366;&#2361;&#2352;&#2339; &#2325;&#2375; &#2354;&#2367;&#2319;, 13 - 13 &#2346;&#2352; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2332;&#2376;&#2360;&#2375; &#2325;&#2367; 13 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2332;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2344;&#2366;/&#2328;&#2335;&#2366;&#2344;&#2366; (&#2337;&#2367;&#2354;&#2368;&#2335;)/&#2327;&#2369;&#2339;&#2366; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2366; &#2310;&#2342;&#2367; &#2325;&#2368; &#2332;&#2366; &#2360;&#2325;&#2340;&#2368; &#2361;&#2376;&#2306;&#2404; 13 &#2325;&#2379; 1 &#2324;&#2352; 3 &#2350;&#2375;&#2306; &#2340;&#2379;&#2337;&#2364;&#2344;&#2366; &#2340;&#2341;&#2366; &#2347;&#2367;&#2352; 1 &#2324;&#2352; 3 &#2346;&#2352; &#2327;&#2339;&#2367;&#2340;&#2368;&#2351; &#2360;&#2306;&#2325;&#2381;&#2352;&#2367;&#2351;&#2366;&#2319;&#2305; &#2325;&#2352;&#2344;&#2375; &#2325;&#2368; &#2309;&#2344;&#2369;&#2350;&#2340;&#2367; &#2344;&#2361;&#2368;&#2306; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;)</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">(12, 15, 20)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(12, 15, 20)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(7,11,26)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(7,11,26)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(24, 36, 10)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(24, 36, 10)</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">(18,12, 26)</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">(18,12, 26)</span>"],"correct_option_id":1,"solution":"<p>The middle number is equal to one third of sum of remaining two numbers.</p><p>Middle number = (1/3) * (first number + third number)</p><p>(1/3) * (16 + 20) = 36/3 = 12</p><p>Similarly,</p><p>(1/3) * (7 + 26) = 33/3 = 11</p><p>Hence the correct answer is '(7,11,26)'.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the option which exhibits the same relationship as it is exhibited by given pair of terms.</p><p>25: 64</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2313;&#2360; &#2357;&#2367;&#2325;&#2354;&#2381;&#2346; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2342;&#2367;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2346;&#2342;&#2379;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2351;&#2369;&#2327;&#2381;&#2350; &#2342;&#2381;&#2357;&#2366;&#2352;&#2366; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2319; &#2327;&#2319; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2306;&#2343; &#2325;&#2375; &#2360;&#2350;&#2366;&#2344; &#2360;&#2306;&#2348;&#2343; &#2325;&#2379; &#2342;&#2352;&#2381;&#2358;&#2366;&#2340;&#2366; &#2361;&#2376;&#2404;</p><p>25: 64</p></span>","options":["<span class=\"eqt\">36 : 49</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">36 : 49</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">4 : 15</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">4 : 15</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">81: 512</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">81: 512</span>","<span class=\"eqt\">64 : 729</span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\">64 : 729</span>"],"correct_option_id":2,"solution":"<p>The given relation is, N<sup>2</sup>: (N  -  1)<sup>3</sup></p> <p>Only 81: 512 represents same relation.</p>","marks":2,"section":null},{"question":"<span class=\"eqt\"><p>Select the set of numbers which is similar to the following set of numbers.</p><p>(2, 4, 12)</p></span><span class=\"hqt\" style=\"display:none\"><p>&#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#2325;&#2375; &#2313;&#2360; &#2360;&#2350;&#2370;&#2361; &#2325;&#2366; &#2330;&#2351;&#2344; &#2325;&#2368;&#2332;&#2367;&#2319; &#2332;&#2379; &#2344;&#2367;&#2350;&#2381;&#2344;&#2354;&#2367;&#2326;&#2367;&#2340; &#2360;&#2306;&#2326;&#2381;&#2351;&#2366;&#2323;&#2306; &#23